  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EBRD - Transfer Agreement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this assignment is to develop the occupational road risk toolkit that can be utilized by the MDBs under the MDB road safety working group applicable to many countries for applied work/research that is transferable.  EBRD have recently identified Tajikistan as a potential focus country where EBRD have been stepping up their activities related to road safety and occupational road risk.  EBRD may therefore use Tajikistan as one of the focal countries to ensure whatever tools are developed are suitable for businesses --and transferable to other Low/Low- Middle Income countries. However, the this may be expanded to other countries and willbe determined. The project is global in nature.</narrative>
  </description>
